SF0081 Tax exemption-property owned by the state.
Sponsored By: Joint Agriculture, State and Public Lands & Water
Resources Interim Committee
AN ACT relating to taxation and revenue; creating a property tax exemption for
property owned by the state; clarifying the taxability of state owned lands;
specifying applicability; providing a sunset date; and providing for an
effective date.
